Fixed several bugs in the SCEPTRE bennu field device module: firmware pulls failing on phenix-deployed devices (the binary is named ``bennu-field-deviced``), client and server services of one protocol being merged, extra ``<input>``/``<output>`` modules being ignored, malformed endpoints or empty elements crashing parsing, and FTP filenames being used as local paths. Lists of data model objects (e.g. registers, tags, and I/O) are now exported in natural sort order of their string fields (e.g. ``I2`` before ``I10``).
